# Weevil K. Neevil, tied to My Little Friends from Amaryllis Webb in Swamp of
# Sorrows (new in Forever).
# Sources: Forever's quest data, quest 93176 (giver, level 25, objectives) and its
# follow-up A Little Help From My Friends (Un'Goro, 50). The quest data
# lists only money as the reward, so how the pet arrives is unconfirmed.

step My Little Friends
  tip Amaryllis Webb gives you an Entomology Starter Kit: use its items to catch an Arbor Tarantula, a Hay Weevil Specimen and a Flesh Picker. This quest is named as the weevil's source but gives only money as its reward; the pet may come from the Hay Weevil you catch. If you lose the kit, she sells another.
  accept 93176 "My Little Friends" @25,54.2 live
  complete 93176 "My Little Friends"
  turnin 93176 "My Little Friends" @25,54.2 live
  collect 280456 "Weevil K. Neevil" @25,54.2 live
